text":"褐色の肌は大陸北部の少数民族の血を引いているため。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穏やかで母性を感じさせる温かな人柄から、学生たちにも人気が高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"望まぬ力を持ってしまったツカサのことを心配しており、何かと気にかけてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"２人の子は姉妹で、姉のメープルも妹のマロンもまだまだ幼い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女たちはツカサとジークのことがお気に入りのようで、何かと遊びにやってくる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"48771"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b7273280e110b21d141855462f12fdd3798e5a56a8af10249bb272eaf8d5fbb6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/94bd44c9230a4e713b321ce5c017261fbd21657ab5a6a1d23425012dea1c296a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"及川ひとみ","creatorId":"vndb:s110","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s110","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s110","name":"及川 ひとみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:198667:48771:13696:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c42055","characterName":"イリス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["3083"],"vndbCharacterId":"c42055"},"originalCharacterName":"イリス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"★The mysterious headmistress of Wizardia Academy★"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the headmistress of Wizardia Magic Academy. While she appears as a young girl, she is actually a highly skilled archmage."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She always maintains a detached aura and calmly watches over the growth of the girls at the academy. She usually leads a rather leisurely life, playing chess with Sieg or wandering around the academy with a bag of snacks in hand."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She seems to be interested in Tsukasa and occasionally tries to contact him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42055"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"このウィザーディア魔法学院の長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外見は幼い少女だが、実は熟達の大魔術師である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に超然とした雰囲気を身にまとっており、のほほんとした様子でこの学院の少女たちの成長を見守っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段はジークを相手にチェスをしたり、茶菓子の入った袋を手にしたまま学院内をぶらついたりと割と暇そうな生活を送っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ツカサのことが気になるようで、時折接触を持ってくる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3083","sourceWorkId":"4551","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1d1a872ec9dd07e58a0ca9b5ad320b405b700800d867e3ca1453942a01d1ac09.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c1/c1a1cb41c25bf95acfecbe1fb9147b69ed04823aaf181603e54a720c365a3b5e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大波 こなみ","creatorId":"vndb:s260","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s260","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s260","name":"幡宮 かのこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:20989","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c42056","characterName":"ジークフリード","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c42056"},"originalCharacterName":"ジークフリード","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/85/857457d9f2564ddfbbb1b9b9fc8698d10e5c5f540ba996a7c61ecf9494179f4f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b72e9928266a71b354c95354552021b5264d507fd9f94c265c401463f722e68e.webp","width":250,"height":250,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"谷 俊介","creatorId":"vndb:s1576","sourcePersonI